# Attachment Scenario - Tests confluence-attachment skill
# File attachment operations
---
prompt: |
  Show me attachments on the Architecture Diagram page
expect:
  tools:
    must_call: [Skill]
  text:
    must_not_contain: [error, "not found"]
  semantic: |
    Response should list any attachments on the Architecture Diagram page,
    or indicate there are no attachments.
---
prompt: |
  List all attachments in the CDEMO space
expect:
  text:
    must_not_contain: [error, failed]
  semantic: |
    Response should list attachments across the space,
    or indicate if there are none.
---
prompt: |
  What types of files can I attach to a Confluence page?
expect:
  text:
    must_contain: [file]
    must_not_contain: [error]
  semantic: |
    Response should describe supported attachment types
    including images, documents, and other files.
---
prompt: |
  How do I upload an attachment to a page?
expect:
  text:
    must_contain: [upload, attachment]
    must_not_contain: [error]
  semantic: |
    Response should explain how to upload attachments,
    mentioning file paths or upload methods.
---
